{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-08-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'AEP ANNOUNCES EXECUTIVE SUCCESSION', 'text': 'CFO JULIE A. SLOAT NAMED PRESIDENT EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY, CEO EFFECTIVE JAN. 1 NICHOLAS K.'}{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2022-08-10 09:00:00', 'title': "TOP NEW YORK RESTAURANTS - BONNIE'S, CROWN SHY, DHAMAKA, TAQUERIA RAMIREZ, RAZZA, SOFREH AND MORE - JOIN FORCES WITH THE AMERICAN EXPRESS® GOLD CARD AND RESY FOR TWO-NIGHT DRIVE-THRU DINING EVENT", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, AMERICAN EXPRESS (NYSE:AXP) AND RESERVATIONS PLATFORM RESY ANNOUNCED THE AMERICAN EXPRESS GOLD CARD PRESENTS THE RESY DRIVE-THRU NEW YORK, A TWO-NIGHT CULINARY EVENT ON FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 16 AND SATURDAY, SEPTEMBER 17, 2022, AT BROOKLYN'S SKYLINE DRIVE-IN. GUESTS WILL SAMPLE A 10-COURSE TASTING MENU FROM SOME OF NEW YORK'S MOST POPULAR CHEFS AND RESTAURANTS, REFLECTING THE DIVERSE CULTURE AND CUISINE OF NEW YORK. THE LINEUP SPANS CANTONESE, INDIAN, PERSIAN, MEXI"}{'symbol': 'BRK-B', 'date': '2022-08-10 03:26:00', 'title': 'BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY SPECIALTY INSURANCE LAUNCHES EXECUTIVE & PROFESSIONAL LINES IN SWITZERLAND, CHRISTOPH KAMMERMANN TO HEAD PRODUCT LINE', 'text': 'BOSTON & ZURICH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY SPECIALTY INSURANCE LAUNCHES EXECUTIVE & PROFESSIONAL LINES IN SWITZERLAND, CHRISTOPH KAMMERMANN TO HEAD PRODUCT LINE'}{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2022-08-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER SECURES SECOND INTEGRATED DRIVE MODULE AWARD WITH HYUNDAI MOTOR COMPANY', 'text': "INTEGRATED DRIVE MODULE (IDM) TO POWER A SECOND HYUNDAI MOTOR COMPANY (HMC) A-SEGMENT ELECTRIC VEHICLE, WITH PRODUCTION STARTING IN 2024 SECOND IDM BUSINESS AWARD WITH HMC IN LESS THAN 2 YEARS TECHNOLOGY PROVIDES HIGH POWER DENSITY AND EFFICIENCY SCALABLE, MODULAR IDM DESIGN CUSTOMIZABLE TO CUSTOMER REQUIREMENTS AUBURN HILLS, MICH., AUG. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BORGWARNER'S IDM146 INTEGRATED DRIVE MODULE\xa0(IDM)\xa0HAS BEEN SELECTED BY HYUNDAI MOTOR COMPANY (HMC) TO POWER AN ADDITIONAL A-SEGMENT