EDING $100K TO INQUIRE ABOUT SECURITIES CLASS ACTION INVESTIGATION - DFS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - AUGUST 10, 2022) - WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, CONTINUES TO INVESTIGATE POTENTIAL SECURITIES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES (NYSE: DFS) RESULTING FROM ALLEGATIONS THAT DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES MAY HAVE ISSUED MATERIALLY MISLEADING BUSINESS INFORMATION TO THE INVESTING PUBLIC.'}{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-08-10 16:15:00', 'title': 'INPRO/SEAL INTRODUCES VBMAG BEARING ISOLATOR TO ADDRESS GROWING NEED FOR BEARING PROTECTION IN FLOODED AND MIST APPLICATIONS', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , AUG. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- INPRO/SEAL, PART OF DOVER PRECISION COMPONENTS\xa0AND DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV),\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS NEW MAGNETIC BEARING ISOLATOR, VBMAG™, WHICH UTILIZES MAGNETIC FORCE TO CREATE A LIQUID-TIGHT SEAL AND PROTECT AGAINST LUBRICATION LOSS AND CONTAMINATION INGRESS IN CHALLENGING APPLICATIONS, SUCH AS FLOODED, HIGH OIL SPLASH OR OIL MIST ENVIRONMENTS.'}{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2022-08-10 16:15:00', 'title': 'DOW DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 70 CENTS PER SHARE', 'text': 'MIDLAND, MICH. , AUG. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOW (NYSE: DOW) HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF 70 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 9, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON AUGUST 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2022-08-10 10:30:00', 'title': 'FORD MOTOR COMPANY AND DTE ENERGY ANNOUNCE THE LARGEST RENEWABLE ENERGY PURCHASE FROM A UTILITY IN U.S. HISTORY', 'text': 'THROUGH ITS MIGREENPOWER PROGRAM, DTE TO ADD 650 MEGAWATTS OF NEW SOLAR ENERGY IN MICHIGAN FOR FORD, INCREASING THE TOTAL AMOUNT OF INSTALLED SOLAR IN MICHIGAN BY NEARLY 70%'}{'symbol': 'EA', 'date': '2022-08-10 09:00:00', 'title': 'ELECTRONIC ARTS AND THE NATIONAL FOOTBALL LEAGUE TO ENTERTAIN MILLIONS OF FOOTBALL FANS THROUGH MULTI-YEAR EXCLUSIVE ESPORTS DEAL RENEWAL', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF. & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TOD