WSWIRE/ -- THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF WFC DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT.'}